  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HoM support to IYWGD for advocacy on SGBV issues</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the project is to promote inclusive prevention to GBV in the district through capacity building and awareness raising on gender and GBV; and to improve referral pathways specific to people with disability. The key project outcomes are:
&#x2022; Increased awareness of women and girls with disability on GBV. 
&#x2022; Heightened/increased awareness of the community, thus leading to increase reporting of GBV cases through established referral pathways.
&#x2022; Specific inclusive local SGBV prevention and response actions are established in Moyamba district during and after the project.</narrative>
  </description>
